                            <comment id="16784349" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 5 Mar 2019 11:50:14 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3231783&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16784350" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 5 Mar 2019 11:55:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, tests look good. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What was broken: &lt;tt&gt;RuntimeException&lt;/tt&gt; handling was missed in &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheAdapter#syncOp&lt;/tt&gt; and because of this, current active transaction was not rolled back and it wasn&apos;t removed from  TxManager maps.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16784472" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 5 Mar 2019 14:08:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What about&#160; IgniteTxHeuristicCheckedException and&#160;IgniteInterruptedCheckedException that are re-thrown above?&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Have you check these ones are handled properly? &lt;br/&gt;
You can try next use case to verify this: user defined IndexingSpi throws some exception that causes TxHeuristic exception on tx commit operation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16785772" author="rkondakov" created="Wed, 6 Mar 2019 15:45:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxHeuristicCheckedException&lt;/tt&gt; is thrown on Dht and Remote nodes after the near transaction is already committed, so there is no need to cleanup tx manager after this exception.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteInterruptedCheckedException&lt;/tt&gt; is thrown when tx is waiting on &lt;tt&gt;get()&lt;/tt&gt; method of &lt;tt&gt;NearEnlistFuture&lt;/tt&gt; or chained &lt;tt&gt;PostLock&lt;/tt&gt; future. So if this waiting is interrupted, anyway we have a finish future which will cleanup tx manager on it&apos;s finish.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16786632" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 7 Mar 2019 11:10:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Got it. PR looks ok.&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks for contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16786643" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 7 Mar 2019 11:18:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
